    narr:narration """This narrative holds a single position on markdown timing: [the two-o'clock markdown, set before close rather than at it](narr:Position_DayOldMarkdownTiming), with the paired point that [the shelf card changes with the price so the till never surprises a buyer](narr:Position_DayOldMarkdownTiming). The frame asks what else on the shop floor has to move with the markdown — the shelf-card answer is the only child that speaks to it so far.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_DayOldMarkdownTiming> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Day-old loaves go to half price at two in the afternoon, not at close. At close nobody is left to buy them." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_DayOldMarkdownTiming> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Then the shelf card changes at two as well, so the price is never a surprise at the till." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_DayOldMarkdownTiming> ] ;
